  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supply of IT Hardware and ancillaries for the State Service of Ukraine on Food Safety and Consumer Protection (SSUFSCP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The State Service of Ukraine for Food Safety and Consumer Protection (SSUFSCP) intends to establish a Continuous Training Centre (CTC) to provide continuous training / refresher to its staff  veterinarians and sanitary / phytosanitary inspectors  based on EU best practices and as recommended by successive audits. This will require the procurement of hardware and ancillaries to equip both the Centre in Kyiv and classrooms in 6 different locations throughout the country.</narrative>
  </description>
